{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Blood Accord",
    "steam_appid": 3484040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/806613380db17bd3f8a4056dcf78ac74.poster.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/806613380db17bd3f8a4056dcf78ac74.webm?t=1746353287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/33a3cb11d99c0d18002f5d05d6c9997a.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood accord is a story inspired by the authors' personal experiences and the creepypasta about Saki Sanobashi, an anime that doesn't exist in reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5f1182c6d4e96da95552fe3beeb7dfcf.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yana wakes up locked inside a public restroom with her two closest friends. There's Vika, fiery and sharp-tongued, a fearless spirit. And Lala, gentle and warm-hearted, a soul that craves harmony. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yana is relieved at first. She's not alone. These are the girls she loves more than life itself and being together again feels like a blessing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as time drags on, the tight space feels less like a refuge and more like a cage. The air thickens with unspoken tension, and long-buried secrets claw their way to the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with every drop of blood dripping from the rusted tap, the past refuses to stay forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/14765b5da02481b25e520bcb5a3176c0.poster.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/14765b5da02481b25e520bcb5a3176c0.webm?t=1746353287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then... she wakes with a jolt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a <strong>dream</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange, unsettling <strong>dream</strong>, but still just a <strong>dream</strong>. Isn't it? Isn't it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet light of her apartment, Yana feels lost and unsure. The cold glow of her computer screen is her only connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can she find answers in her messages, forgotten journal notes, and memories? Will online\u00a0strangers  advice help her solve the mystery before it\u2019s too late? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5985c82f9fd8b9a1740a34fcd94cda9f.poster.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5985c82f9fd8b9a1740a34fcd94cda9f.webm?t=1746353287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her time is running short: the truth awaits, but its price may be more than she can bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/e25c2b0cf51fdd37434f12f7d7c22977.poster.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/e25c2b0cf51fdd37434f12f7d7c22977.webm?t=1746353287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/72b0e548cf0097a15ccfbce9ac6660a3.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story:</strong> Over 90 minutes of story, with 25+ beautifully illustrated scenes and an original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter:</strong> Branching paths and moral decisions. Your choices have consequences for Yana and her world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Experience:</strong> Interact with Yana's computer. Explore files, read and answer messages, discover her past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resonant Story:</strong> A human story about uncertainty and the search for meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layered Narrative:</strong> A story with multiple interpretations and hidden meanings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Voice Acting:</strong> All characters are voiced by actors (in Russian).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content:</strong>\u00a0extreme gore, despairing madness, and excessive bloodshed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/580b8e5234251c555e11431a43c2187a.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5a50991b2e2af7ec8ff0880036780cdb.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadness, sadness, sadness... Angst, angst, angst... Pain, pain, pain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking disaster, a human embodiment of chaos. She's not easy for those around her. Why? She's forbidden us from telling you about herself. You'll find out everything in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yana desperately needs friends, and we sincerely hope you'll get along with her. She's on the edge of her life. Will you lead her to salvation or destruction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/f3b3b7d37c3f0a73c321488c1668d2fb.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innocent soul lost in a sea of madness. Gentle, kind, and accommodating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she stay this sweet, or will the shadows within her rise to consume Yana?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/85b63f3ef23fe0361aa0a481a7ceeed8.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's just say she's...extra. From her &quot;business casual&quot; attire (a bra as a top? Seriously?) to her explosive, impulsive personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vika's about to unleash a hurricane of drama. And...how does she really feel about Yana?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/a04ca54bf2bcf422405f13df4a16eb2a.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/1a9dbfb84efab4f69a7b2f82fca9b1fc.poster.avif?t=1746353287\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/1a9dbfb84efab4f69a7b2f82fca9b1fc.webm?t=1746353287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
